    "Complete interleaved style chain. `styles[]` in the Site IR carries the linked subset only, because v1 requires an `href` and forbids unknown properties such as `origin`; the gaps in its `order` values are the inline blocks listed here.",
    "Deduplicated by CSS sha256: Divi repeats the same theme block on every page, so a block may carry many pages.",
    "Deferred CSS (cl-site-convert-mzi): 18 Divi deferred sheets (11 distinct files after sha256 dedup) were captured under capture/assets/styles/deferred/ and inserted at the position each page's live document gave them. The chain was extended by a stable topological merge, so every existing entry kept its relative order and 27 shifted index."
